cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the version you actually ran. The
  version DOI fixes the files; the concept DOI always resolves to the latest.
title: "slabx: a Python reimplementation of the SLAB dense-gas dispersion model"
abstract: >-
  A Python reimplementation of SLAB (Ermak 1990, UCRL-MA-105607), verified
  against the original Fortran on the five worked examples of the manual and
  on randomly sampled input decks, and evaluated against field and
  wind-tunnel trials. Coefficients are exposed rather than embedded, so
  sensitivity and ablation studies need no edits to the source. The original
  Fortran and the validation observations are third-party and are not
  redistributed; their sources and the transformations applied are recorded
  in machine-readable manifests.
type: software
